hat You Need\",\"description\":\"Build an AI layer that predicts what users want to see next based on their exploration patterns, research context, and domain expertise. As users read findings, the system pre-loads relevant entities, sources, and perspectives. Views dynamically recompose themselves to surface the most relevant content. Show predicted paths like 'Users who explored this finding often looked at...' creating serendipitous discovery.\",\"reasoning\":\"Users currently navigate views linearly without guidance. A predictive layer would anticipate needs, reducing cognitive load while accelerating insight discovery. This creates a personalized intelligence experience that learns and improves with each research session.\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"user_feedback\":null,\"user_pattern\":0,\"effort\":null,\"impact\":null,\"risk\":null,\"requirement_id\":null,\"goal_id\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:10:30.336Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:10:30.336Z\",\"implemented_at\":null}}\r","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false}}
