[2026-01-30T00:10:46.214Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XLYposN7aS727xKMHMxd4E","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"idea\":{\"id\":\"f19eab06-9f93-4bbe-827f-f54b5244f469\",\"scan_id\":\"27e2bf15-acb5-4d49-9d44-347339391e5e\",\"project_id\":\"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\"context_id\":\"ctx_1769727787448_l3eo5wl\",\"scan_type\":\"moonshot_architect\",\"category\":\"user_benefit\",\"title\":\"Universal View Export Engine\",\"description\":\"Build a universal export engine that can render any view into any format: PowerPoint presentations with speaker notes, PDF briefings with executive summaries, interactive web embeds, Notion pages, Slack-ready digests, or email newsletters. Each format is AI-optimized for its medium. Views become the single source of truth that powers all downstream deliverables automatically.\",\"reasoning\":\"Analysts spend enormous time reformatting research for different audiences. A universal export engine eliminates this busywork entirely. One research session produces all deliverables - briefings, presentations, updates - with format-appropriate content automatically generated.\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"user_feedback\":null,\"user_pattern\":0,\"effort\":null,\"impact\":null,\"risk\":null,\"requirement_id\":null,\"goal_id\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:10:45.977Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:10:45.977Z\",\"implemented_at\":null}}","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"4b33b8e3-d84d-4fcf-af4b-b97efcbcb9ee","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"{\"idea\":{\"id\":\"f19eab06-9f93-4bbe-827f-f54b5244f469\",\"scan_id\":\"27e2bf15-acb5-4d49-9d44-347339391e5e\",\"project_id\":\"b0c59faa-dddf-4ab1-9308-718ebe3ec829\",\"context_id\":\"ctx_1769727787448_l3eo5wl\",\"scan_type\":\"moonshot_architect\",\"category\":\"user_benefit\",\"title\":\"Universal View Export Engine\",\"description\":\"Build a universal export engine that can render any view into any format: PowerPoint presentations with speaker notes, PDF briefings with executive summaries, interactive web embeds, Notion pages, Slack-ready digests, or email newsletters. Each format is AI-optimized for its medium. Views become the single source of truth that powers all downstream deliverables automatically.\",\"reasoning\":\"Analysts spend enormous time reformatting research for different audiences. A universal export engine eliminates this busywork entirely. One research session produces all deliverables - briefings, presentations, updates - with format-appropriate content automatically generated.\",\"status\":\"pending\",\"user_feedback\":null,\"user_pattern\":0,\"effort\":null,\"impact\":null,\"risk\":null,\"requirement_id\":null,\"goal_id\":null,\"created_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:10:45.977Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-01-30T00:10:45.977Z\",\"implemented_at\":null}}\r","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false}}
[2026-01-30T00:10:57.443Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01CbRndsi3NJK7qZkxVNaPzT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've completed the moonshot idea generation for the Report Views context.\n\n**Summary: Moonshot Ideas for Report Views Context**\n\nCreated 5 moonshot ideas for the Report Views context (ctx_1769727787448_l3eo5wl):\n\n1. **Autonomous Research Agent Within Views** - Embed an AI agent directly in views that users can chat with, spawning follow-up queries and expanding visualizations in real-time as users ask questions\n\n2. **Predictive View Synthesis - Show What You Need** - AI layer that predicts what users want to see next, pre-loading relevant content and dynamically recomposing views to surface the most relevant information\n\n3. **Immersive Narrative Mode - Story-Driven Research** - Transform views into a documentary-style narrative experience with AI-generated voice narration, cinematic transitions, and pacing that builds to conclusions\n\n4. **Multi-User Real-Time Collaborative Views** - Enable simultaneous multi-user exploration with shared cursors, spatial annotations, live discussions, and video conferencing integration\n\n5. **Universal View Export Engine** - Render any view into any format (PowerPoint, PDF, Notion, Slack, email newsletters) with AI-optimized content for each medium\n\n**Observations about the Report Views codebase:**\n- Sophisticated view architecture with 6 distinct full-page views (Overview, Findings, Sources, Analysis, Entities, Perspectives)\n- Rich visualization components integrated (EntityConstellation, SourceNetwork, TrustRadar, CausalFlow, ContradictionMatrix, ConfidenceHeatmap, Timeline)\n- Already has video/static view mode toggle in OverviewView - foundation for narrative experiences\n- Strong filtering, sorting, and multi-view modes (cards/network/radar/constellation)\n- Theme-aware rendering throughout (radar/swiss)\n- Framer Motion animations for polished interactions\n- Expandable detail panels with AnimatePresence for smooth transitions"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3754,"cache_read_input_tokens":96283,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3754},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05d3e4f1-2259-4f3e-a055-8040a34c8b02","uuid":"dd377920-c820-42df-b668-8139db9841ea"}
